# Browsers must check for a new version of the app's code every time. Otherwise they can keep
# an old script for hours and combine it with a newer page, which stops the app from starting.
# On day.summershots.org the zone's Browser Cache TTL still sets scripts to 4 hours, so there the
# service worker's no-cache fetches and the recovery script in index.html provide the protection.
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache

/icons/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
